Z||000004||Kelvin Vivian||03-30-2001||08:46 PM||||Pretty, pretty... <P>What was that black strip on the driver seat? It looks like some buttons/controls are on it. I heard of some 88s having adjustable side lumbar support for the seats, I've never seen a Fiero with one, or maybe they don't exist...||||reg||1
Z||000005||docprego||03-30-2001||09:21 PM||||Thanks everyone, I am so excited to have this awesome car.  I feel like I practically stole it at $3700.<P>Kelvin-that is the power lumbar seat, a very rare option on an 88 I am told.  Apparently only 800 or so 88's had this option. <P>Now to start fixing up the minor stuff to make it perfect.  What do you people think of the black rims?  I was thinking about replacing them with 5 spoke stars, but then again I don't think I want to take away from the stock look.<P>The stereo also needs some major help, even though it has the factory sub option.<P>Thanks again and I welcome any advice.<P>docprego <A HREF="http://www.playitagain-games.com" TARGET=_blank>www.playitagain-games.com</A> <P><BR>||||reg||10
Z||000006||Veronica's V6 GT||03-30-2001||11:10 PM||||Great looking car, but then I'm a little prejudice. I have one that looks exactly like yours.  Except unlike yours mine could use a paint job soon.  How many miles on yours?  ||||reg||1
Z||000007||docprego||03-30-2001||11:17 PM||||Body has 122K on it, new engine has 3K on it.<P>The paint is original and to my amazement looks incredible in person.  There is not a single ding or dent on this car.  <P>Before buying it I had it thoroughly ( I mean thoroughly-hour and a half) inspected by a non biased auto inspection company.  The inspector said it had definitely never been in an accident and Carfax said the title was clean...<P>I just got real lucky to find this prize!<P>docprego <A HREF="http://www.playitagain-games.com" TARGET=_blank>www.playitagain-games.com</A> <BR>||||reg||1
Z||000008||Tigger||03-30-2001||11:44 PM||||Great find!<P>Hehe...  You won't find too many dents and dings with Fieros.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||14
Z||000009||Veronica's V6 GT||03-30-2001||11:52 PM||||Boy and I thought I got a good deal on mine. I paid $4000 for mine and it has 81k on it.  Mine didn't have the lumbar seats, in fact the 88 seats were replaced by 87 seats at some point.  I only learned that after I owned it a few months.  But I'm expecting 88 skins in the mail any day now.  The body I feel is in excellent shape.   The nose has a small area about the size of a dollar where it had bumped into something and it left lines in the paint. ||||reg||1
Z||000010||docprego||03-31-2001||12:24 AM||||Good point Tigger, well wherever a Fiero could potentially be dented or dinged, this one has not been  :-)<P>docprego <A HREF="http://www.playitagain-games.com" TARGET=_blank>www.playitagain-games.com</A> <BR>||||reg||1
